    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so exhausting though. people see me and think i have it all figured out, so i can't even talk to them about it. i feel like i'm just performing. i'm tired of the performance. i just want to feel... something. anything. even if it's just to make this numbness stop. i just want it to be quiet in my head.",
